  "display_title": "The Devil Judge",
  "description": "Kang Yo-Han rises to fame as the first judge to preside a nationally broadcasted trial. With his decisive judgement and good looks, he is lauded a hero to bring much-needed change in the Korean justice system. However, his junior judge, Kim Ga-On, finds something amiss about Yo-Han... Whose sociopathic tendencies suggest he may be not entirely what he seems... Is Kang Yo-Han a truly heroic judge as the people think? Or is he just a devil in disguise?\n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)",
